E
war map plan scrawled~
The map is drawn in charcoal on a scrap of hide.  It shows the great
cavern, the long tunnel east to the chasm, and a great many arrows.  One
arrow is labeled "trolls come".  Another, pointing up toward the
surface, is labeled "then gnomes".  A third, pointing off the edge of
the hide, is labeled "then everybody".  In the margin someone has drawn
a small kobold wearing a very large crown.
~
